@startuml shared_delivery_provenance
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
}
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Where is each Observation input frozen?
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Mutable inputs (live state)\nswitch / filter, Heart / Lung, point, configuration,\npending examination request, server Device id,\nSNTP clock anchors, BPM estimates" as live
rectangle "Session admission (accepted Start)\ncopy point, configuration, filter IDs,\nexamination identity / supplied patient reference" as admission
rectangle "Finalized result (Finalizing): frozen context + this session's estimates\nkind: heart rate or poor-signal report,\nBPM value + declared precision,\nmonotonic measurement end" as result
rectangle "Admitted job: CONTROL submits the finalized result\ncopy of the result; freeze server Device id;\nfreeze UTC measurement end if a qualifying\nanchor already maps it (dashed: read once from live state)" as job
rectangle "First delivery connection setup (only if UTC end still open)\nits SNTP exchange supplies the anchor;\nfreeze UTC end once if still open" as setup
rectangle "Serialize once before the first request\nObservation body + If-None-Exist condition\n(identifier = Device id : UTC end)" as bytes
rectangle "Attempts 1..4 (P13)\nevery retry sends the identical bytes" as retries
live --> admission
admission --> result
live --> result
result --> job
live ..> job
job --> setup
job --> bytes
setup --> bytes
bytes --> retries
legend bottom
 After its freeze point a value is never read again from live state; no anchor by the deadline: SERVER_CONNECTION_FAILURE, nothing sent.
endlegend
@enduml
